PacketFlowDPI
=============

This repository contains the open-source part of PacketFlowDPI:

  * the Android TV user interface;
  * the generic VPN transport: VpnService, the tun loop, the userspace
    TCP state machine, the UDP relay, and the IPv4/TCP/UDP packet helpers;
  * a minimal TLS ClientHello/SNI parser.

The DPI-desync engine is proprietary and is NOT included in this repository.
In the open build, Strategy.plan() returns the payload as a single piece and
Desync.writeFirst() writes it unchanged. The open build therefore does not
bypass DPI.

